<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame frame--creed">
    <p class="kicker">Closing Stance</p>
    <p>This is where the framework becomes checkable, and so where it becomes vulnerable. The right test
      is not whether the percentages match &mdash; they were known before the function was written
      &mdash; but whether f(z) can be shown to be forced. Until the uniqueness proof exists, the Ledger
      is an elegant account of numbers already in hand.</p>
